{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        36.0,
        21.884788513183594,
        63.09400177001953,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Second",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.188232421875,
        513.4144897460938,
        96.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "The evidence and considerations underlying each recommendation reviewed by the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18475341796875,
        463.3550109863281,
        112.5362548828125
      ],
      "text": "Panel are presented in Annex 1. Recommendations were classified as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        123.62313842773438,
        513.4060668945312,
        137.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "strong recommendation  A  – the desirable effects of adherence to the recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        127.36404418945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        135.36404418945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        139.68865966796875,
        513.4061889648438,
        153.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "clearly outweigh the undesirable effects. The strong recommendations in this edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        155.6851806640625,
        433.8030700683594,
        169.03668212890625
      ],
      "text": "use the words “should” or “should not”. No alternatives are listed.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        177.62313842773438,
        513.4174194335938,
        191.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "conditional recommendation A   – the desirable effects of adherence to the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        181.36404418945312,
        91.36740112304688,
        189.36404418945312
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        193.68865966796875,
        513.4176635742188,
        207.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation probably outweigh the undesirable effects but the trade-offs are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        209.6851806640625,
        334.2704772949219,
        223.03668212890625
      ],
      "text": "uncertain. Reasons for uncertainty can include:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        229.49212646484375,
        423.79046630859375,
        242.95863342285156
      ],
      "text": "lack of high-quality evidence to support the recommendation; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        248.96142578125,
        389.2789611816406,
        262.42791748046875
      ],
      "text": "limited benefits of implementing the recommendation; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        268.43072509765625,
        285.3648986816406,
        281.897216796875
      ],
      "text": "costs not justified by the benefits; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.58940124511719,
        288.5,
        269.7823791503906,
        301.96649169921875
      ],
      "text": "imprecise estimates of benefit. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        310.166015625,
        513.3754272460938,
        323.51751708984375
      ],
      "text": "The Panel had to consider whether the strength of existing recommendations, some",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        326.1625061035156,
        513.4445190429688,
        339.5140075683594
      ],
      "text": "of which were based on data in adults, could be confidently extrapolated to paediatric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        342.15899658203125,
        513.3983764648438,
        355.510498046875
      ],
      "text": "populations. In some instances, the Panel was confident in making this extrapolation,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        358.1554870605469,
        513.4561157226562,
        371.5069885253906
      ],
      "text": "particularly where data were available that are directly applicable to children. In",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        374.1519775390625,
        513.3984985351562,
        387.50347900390625
      ],
      "text": "other cases, the Panel considered that more research is necessary before a strong",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        390.1484680175781,
        513.3639526367188,
        403.4999694824219
      ],
      "text": "recommendation can be confirmed. Where evidence is weak or lacking, areas for future",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        406.14495849609375,
        290.1833801269531,
        419.4964599609375
      ],
      "text": "research were suggested (see Chapter 9).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        430.6514587402344,
        513.4099731445312,
        444.0029602050781
      ],
      "text": "On the basis of new evidence, the Panel modified the existing recommendations in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        446.64794921875,
        188.35092163085938,
        459.99945068359375
      ],
      "text": "following two areas:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        468.97711181640625,
        293.24224853515625,
        482.443603515625
      ],
      "text": "IPT in children living with HIV; and,  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        489.0464172363281,
        303.25885009765625,
        502.5129089355469
      ],
      "text": "lower range of the dose of isoniazid.  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        510.71240234375,
        513.3985595703125,
        524.0639038085938
      ],
      "text": "The most recent evidence on the use of rapid molecular diagnostics in childhood TB was",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        526.7089233398438,
        332.75634765625,
        540.0604248046875
      ],
      "text": "reviewed by a separate expert panel in May 2013.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        551.2153930664062,
        513.4444580078125,
        564.56689453125
      ],
      "text": "Other existing recommendations were either approved in full or were modified to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        567.2118530273438,
        221.98828125,
        580.5633544921875
      ],
      "text": "specifically address children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        591.7183837890625,
        513.3869018554688,
        605.0698852539062
      ],
      "text": "The draft second edition went through an extensive process of peer review. Experts from",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        607.7149047851562,
        513.4213256835938,
        621.06640625
      ],
      "text": "around the world (geographically representative and gender-balanced) with an interest",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        623.7113647460938,
        513.386962890625,
        637.0628662109375
      ],
      "text": "in the subject read through the entire draft guideline and provided useful feedback (see",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        639.7078857421875,
        513.432861328125,
        653.0593872070312
      ],
      "text": "“Acknowledgements”). Reviewers indicated where useful clarifications could be made",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        655.7044067382812,
        513.3983154296875,
        669.055908203125
      ],
      "text": "to the text; they could not, however, change the text of the recommendations as crafted",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        671.700927734375,
        513.37548828125,
        685.0524291992188
      ],
      "text": "by the Panel unless they were able to present a significant body of evidence that the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        687.6974487304688,
        513.4214477539062,
        701.0489501953125
      ],
      "text": "Panel had not yet considered and that contradicted the existing recommendation. In the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        703.6939086914062,
        513.4674682617188,
        717.04541015625
      ],
      "text": "event, this did not happen. Comments and suggestions from the peer reviewers have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        719.6904296875,
        413.27935791015625,
        733.0419311523438
      ],
      "text": "been incorporated into the revised guidance to the extent possible.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        744.1968994140625,
        513.4445190429688,
        757.5484008789062
      ],
      "text": "The Steering Group oversaw the writing of the second edition of the guidance and was",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03480529785156,
        760.1934204101562,
        234.3507843017578,
        773.544921875
      ],
      "text": "responsible for its finalization.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
        36.44280242919922,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "18",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}